        "shortName": "Old Key",
        "description": "An unusually long bronze key, heavily encrusted with a mottled green patina. The bow features intricate, almost religious cutouts and sharp points, while the shaft is adorned with strange geometric spheres and cubes. The simple, heavily worn teeth suggest a lock that predates modern Tarkov's infrastructure by centuries. While most locals dismiss it as useless ceremonial scrap, rumor has it the Collector has a deep, obsessive interest in finding this exact artifact and whatever forgotten vault it belongs to."
